  "limits": [
    "Selected current apartment complexes with recorded permit classes; not a census of all redevelopment projects.",
    "Earliest recorded start to latest approval among matching-year non-shared residential main buildings; not district designation, relocation or move-in duration.",
    "Other recorded permits are not verified non-renewal or new-town projects; missing permit classes are excluded.",
    "Household size is the current verified count, not a historical construction-time inventory.",
    "Forty complete-date complexes required for joint quartiles; unsupported includes absent, small and unverified groups.",
    "Rounded quartiles are not confidence intervals or exact equality tests; no causal duration or future schedule prediction.",
    "No identities, exact group sizes, household totals, individual dates, date sums or transaction equations."
  ]
